<title>UK: Xenova in compound library pact with Zeneca.</title>
<headline>Xenova in compound library pact with Zeneca.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drug discovery group Xenova Group Plc said on Wednesday that it has agreed with Zeneca Group Plc to collaborate in the discovery of novel pharmaceuticals from its natural compound libraries (QTC).</p>
</text>
